# The I/L's first job node: a structure that shocks what stands in front of the
# character every time lightning strikes it, for twenty seconds.
#
# A Final Attack rather than a clock, which is what GMS's ark is -- nothing but
# the lightning moves it. Split Shot is the same shape, and the reach is stated
# the same way: the shock carries its own mobCount of 15 and its own 480x625
# box, so behind Chain Lightning, a swing that reaches six, it still reaches
# fifteen.
#
# Which lightning is the group rather than a list of names. GMS names Parabolic
# Bolt, Thunder Sphere and Cryo Shock, and this game has only the second -- as
# an orb on its own clock, which is what follows_own_clock is for. Read as the
# element it follows that orb, Chain Lightning, Thunder Bolt and Lightning Orb,
# which is what "struck by lightning" means in this book.
#
# The 0.1s reactivation cooldown is not built: nothing here comes round faster
# than 0.24s at the speed cap, so it never binds.
name: "Frost Ark"
description:
  "Manifest the very essence of ice and lightning into a magical structure. "
  "Each time the structure is struck by lightning, it shoots out a blast of "
  "frozen electricity, dealing ice and lightning damage to nearby enemies."
kind: SKILL_KIND_ACTIVE
placement { job_advancement: JOB_ADVANCEMENT_ICE_LIGHTNING_ARCH_MAGE_V skill_order: 1 }
v_node: V_NODE_KIND_JOB
max_level: 30
base_delay_ms: 120
cooldown_seconds: 120.0
follows_skill_tag: SKILL_TAG_LIGHTNING
follows_own_clock: true
final_attack_max_enemies: 15
buff {
  duration_seconds: 20.0
  base {
    final_attack_chance: 1.0
    final_attack_pct: 1.82
    final_attack_lines: 5
  }
  per_level { final_attack_pct: 0.07 }
}
